{"_id":"tat0001","name":"Balance","type":"tattoo","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Increase or decrease spell TNs targeting you by 2×School Rank+5.</p><p><em>[CR p.165]</em></p>","effect":"This tattoo of the spiritual yin-yang symbol calms the mind and spirit. While this tattoo is active, the TN of all Spell Casting Rolls made with you as the target are increased or decreased by an amount equal to twice your School Rank plus 5. You determine whether this is an increase or a decrease when you activate the tattoo."},"effects":[{"name":"Balance (Manual)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"instructions":"Complex ability - see description for full effect"}}}],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Tattoos","sort":100000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"tat0002","name":"Bamboo","type":"tattoo","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Armor TN +2×School Rank+5.</p><p><em>[CR p.165]</em></p>","effect":"The bamboo plant is ubiquitous throughout the Empire, and is well known not only for the speed with which it grows, but also its durability. While this tattoo is active, your Armor TN is increased by an amount equal to twice your School Rank + 5."},"effects":[{"name":"Bamboo (Configure)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"instructions":"Armor TN +2×School Rank+5. Configure based on current School Rank."}}}],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Tattoos","sort":200000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"tat0003","name":"Blaze","type":"tattoo","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Unarmed attacks deal +Fire Ring+School Rank fire damage.</p><p><em>[CR p.165]</em></p>","effect":"The power and fury of fire is unleashed in the Blaze tattoo. When activated, this tattoo causes your unarmed strikes to be bolstered with pure fire. Your unarmed attacks are accompanied by flickering flames that inflict an additional amount of fire damage equal to your Fire Ring plus your School Rank."},"effects":[{"name":"Blaze (Manual)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"instructions":"Complex ability - see description for full effect"}}}],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Tattoos","sort":300000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"tat0004","name":"Centipede","type":"tattoo","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Move Water Ring×100 feet in one day (Complex Move). Exhausted 12 hours after.</p><p><em>[CR p.165]</em></p>","effect":"The tiny centipede has hundreds of legs working in unison, and that power can be commanded by the monks who bear its image. When this tattoo is activated, you may make a special Complex Move Action that allows you to move a distance equal to your Water Ring x 100. This effect lasts for an entire day, essentially allowing you to cross the face of the Empire in a day. If you stop for more than one minute, the effect ends. When the effect ends, you collapse into an exhausted state and can take no physical actions for a period of twelve hours."},"effects":[{"name":"Centipede (Manual)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"instructions":"Complex ability - see description for full effect"}}}],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Tattoos","sort":400000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"tat0005","name":"Crab","type":"tattoo","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Reduction equal to Earth Ring.</p><p><em>[CR p.165]</em></p>","effect":"The tiny crab is resilient beyond all measure for its size. While this tattoo is active, you gain a Reduction rating equal to your Earth Ring."},"effects":[{"name":"Crab (Configure)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"instructions":"Reduction equal to Earth Ring. Configure based on current Earth Ring."}}}],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Tattoos","sort":500000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"tat0006","name":"Crane","type":"tattoo","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Gain School Rank+Air Ring bonus dice for Social Skills (+1k0 each, max Void Ring per roll). Lasts 1 hour.</p><p><em>[CR p.165]</em></p>","effect":"The crane is a symbol of luck and beauty. When you activate this tattoo, you gain a number of bonus dice equal to your School Rank plus your Air Ring. These dice may be spent on any Social Skill Rolls. Each die contributes a bonus of +1k0. If these bonus dice are not used within an hour, they are lost. You may not add more bonus dice to a single roll than your Void Ring. This tattoo is considered active the entire hour, and if another tattoo is activated, any unspent dice from this tattoo are lost."},"effects":[{"name":"Crane (Manual)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"instructions":"Complex ability - see description for full effect"}}}],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Tattoos","sort":600000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"tat0007","name":"Dragon","type":"tattoo","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Breathe fire cone (10ft+School Rank length, 5ft wide). DR = Fire Ring. Take Fire Ring damage.</p><p><em>[CR p.165]</em></p>","effect":"The dragon is a fearsome tattoo, and contains frightening power waiting to be unleashed. As a Complex Action, you may breathe fire in a cone, equal to ten feet plus your School Rank in length, and five feet wide at the end. This fire deals damage to all in its area of effect, with a DR equal your Fire Ring. You take damage equal to your Fire Ring upon each use."},"effects":[{"name":"Dragon (Manual)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"instructions":"Complex ability - see description for full effect"}}}],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Tattoos","sort":700000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"tat0008","name":"Hawk","type":"tattoo","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Leap Water Ring×25 feet (Complex Action).</p><p><em>[CR p.165]</em></p>","effect":"You may borrow the essence of the hawk, and cover great distances with ease. As a Complex Action, you may leap a distance equal to your Water Ring x 25."},"effects":[{"name":"Hawk (Manual)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"instructions":"Complex ability - see description for full effect"}}}],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Tattoos","sort":800000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"tat0009","name":"Ki-rin","type":"tattoo","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Re-roll any one roll per round (keep higher).</p><p><em>[CR p.165]</em></p>","effect":"There are few omens of good fortune more significant than that of the sacred ki-rin. Upon activating this tattoo, you may immediately re-roll any one roll per round, keeping the higher of the two results."},"effects":[{"name":"Ki-rin (Manual)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"instructions":"Complex ability - see description for full effect"}}}],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Tattoos","sort":900000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"tat0010","name":"Lion","type":"tattoo","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Gain School Rank in any Bugei Skill.</p><p><em>[CR p.165]</em></p>","effect":"The lion is a proud and noble warrior. Upon activating this tattoo, you gain ranks equal to your School Rank in any Bugei Skill of your choice."},"effects":[{"name":"Lion (Configure)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"instructions":"Gain School Rank in any Bugei Skill. Player must configure for chosen skill."}}}],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Tattoos","sort":1000000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"tat0011","name":"Mantis","type":"tattoo","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Immune to Fear (always active, doesn't prevent other tattoos).</p><p><em>[CR p.165]</em></p>","effect":"The mantis is a fierce and fearless warrior out of all proportion to its tiny size. Upon receiving this tattoo, you are completely immune to all Fear effects. This tattoo is active at all times, and does not prevent the use of other tattoos."},"effects":[{"name":"Mantis: Fear Immunity","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","disabled":false,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"description":"Immune to all Fear effects. Always active, does not prevent other tattoos."}}}],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Tattoos","sort":1100000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"tat0012","name":"Mountain","type":"tattoo","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Reduce Wound Penalties by School Rank+2.</p><p><em>[CR p.165]</em></p>","effect":"The mountain is eternal and unmoving. When you activate this tattoo, all your Wound Penalties are reduced by an amount equal to your School Rank plus 2."},"effects":[{"name":"Mountain (Configure)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"instructions":"Reduce Wound Penalties by School Rank+2. Configure based on current School Rank."}}}],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Tattoos","sort":1200000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"tat0013","name":"Ocean","type":"tattoo","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","system":{"description":"<p>No need for food/drink. Activate: Refresh as 8 hours sleep, regain all Void. Once per 3 days.</p><p><em>[CR p.165]</em></p>","effect":"The ocean's boundless depths hold the secrets of life and rejuvenation. When granted this tattoo, you no longer have need of food or drink, although you may still partake of them if you wish. When this tattoo is activated, you are instantly refreshed as if you had spent eight hours of sleep, and you regain all spent Void Points. This tattoo may only be used once every three days."},"effects":[{"name":"Ocean (Manual)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"instructions":"Complex ability - see description for full effect"}}}],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Tattoos","sort":1300000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"tat0014","name":"Phoenix","type":"tattoo","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Auto-activates at Down or below (requires 1+ Void). Lose all Void, heal School Rank×10 Wounds. Once per week.</p><p><em>[CR p.165]</em></p>","effect":"The Phoenix can never truly be defeated, rising as it does from the ashes to be born anew. You must have at least one unspent Void Point for this tattoo to be triggered. When you are reduced to the Down Wound Level or below, this tattoo automatically activates. All unspent Void Points are lost, and you immediately heal a number of Wounds equal to your School Rank x 10. This tattoo cannot be activated more than once per week."},"effects":[{"name":"Phoenix (Manual)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"instructions":"Complex ability - see description for full effect"}}}],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Tattoos","sort":1400000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"tat0015","name":"Scorpion","type":"tattoo","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Stealth rolls +School Rank dice. Unarmed attacks Daze if damage dice explode.</p><p><em>[CR p.165]</em></p>","effect":"The scorpion is silent and deadly. While this tattoo is active, you roll additional dice on any Stealth Skill Roll equal to your School Rank. Also, during this time your unarmed attacks automatically Daze your opponent if any dice explode on your damage roll."},"effects":[{"name":"Scorpion (Configure)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"instructions":"Stealth rolls +School Rank dice. Unarmed attacks Daze if damage dice explode."}}}],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Tattoos","sort":1500000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"tat0016","name":"Spider","type":"tattoo","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Move on walls/ceilings at half speed.</p><p><em>[CR p.165]</em></p>","effect":"The spider is quick and dexterous, escaping predators with its speed and agility. While this tattoo is active, you may move across vertical and inverted surfaces (such as sheer walls or ceilings) while making Move Actions. You move at half your normal rate when doing so."},"effects":[{"name":"Spider (Manual)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"instructions":"Complex ability - see description for full effect"}}}],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Tattoos","sort":1600000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"tat0017","name":"Storm","type":"tattoo","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Knockdown Maneuver requires only 1 Raise on unarmed attacks.</p><p><em>[CR p.165]</em></p>","effect":"The storm is nature's fury, and few can stand against its raw power. While this tattoo is active, your unarmed attacks require only one Raise to use the Knockdown Maneuver."},"effects":[{"name":"Storm (Manual)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"instructions":"Complex ability - see description for full effect"}}}],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Tattoos","sort":1700000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"tat0018","name":"Void","type":"tattoo","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Sense all life within School Rank×10 feet radius.</p><p><em>[CR p.165]</em></p>","effect":"This ink black kanji represents oneness with all. When this tattoo is activated, you gain awareness of all life around you. You know the location and rough details of all living things within a radius of your School Rank x 10', even if you cannot see them. You know only rough details, such as \"two warriors\" or \"a pair of rabbits,\" not specific identities. You can recognize individuals well-known to you, however."},"effects":[{"name":"Void (Manual)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"instructions":"Complex ability - see description for full effect"}}}],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Tattoos","sort":1800000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"tat0019","name":"Wind","type":"tattoo","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Gain additional Simple Action (not for attacks). No Water Ring×20 movement limit.</p><p><em>[CR p.165]</em></p>","effect":"The wind is swift and moves without hindrance. While this tattoo is active, you gain an additional Simple Action per round, which may not be used to make an attack. Your maximum total movement is not limited to your Water Ring x 20."},"effects":[{"name":"Wind (Manual)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"instructions":"Complex ability - see description for full effect"}}}],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Tattoos","sort":1900000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"tat0020","name":"Wolf","type":"tattoo","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Hunting (Tracking) gains School Rank Free Raises. Lasts School Rank hours.</p><p><em>[CR p.165]</em></p>","effect":"The wolf is the great tracker of the wilds. When you activate this tattoo, your senses become superhumanly sharp, allowing you to perceive small details and even individual scents. You gain a number of Free Raises on Hunting (Tracking) Skill Rolls equal to your School Rank. This tattoo's effect lasts a number of hours equal to your School Rank."},"effects":[{"name":"Wolf (Configure)","icon":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/advantage.webp","disabled":true,"transfer":true,"changes":[],"flags":{"l5r4-enhanced":{"template":true,"instructions":"Hunting (Tracking) gains School Rank Free Raises. Lasts School Rank hours."}}}],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Advanced Abilities/Tattoos","sort":2000000,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
